        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Barnewall, the deposed king in the Glorious Revolution, the man who acquired Grace Dieu Abbey\n- Events: Glorious Revolution of 1688\n- Places: Grace Dieu Abbey\n\nFacts:\n- In 1541, a man acquired Grace Dieu Abbey.\n- Nicholas Barnewall was the grandson of the man who acquired Grace Dieu Abbey in 1541.\n- In 1688, the Glorious Revolution deposed a king.\n- Nicholas Barnewall supported the king who was deposed in the Glorious Revolution of 1688.",
